{"type":"message","id":"b7b48da3","parentId":"5f47e943","timestamp":"2026-04-10T06:19:05.080Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent \"？\" - this is a very brief message. It could mean:\n1. They're confused or surprised by my previous response\n2. They're waiting for something\n3. They sent it accidentally\n4. They're asking \"what?\" in a confused way\n\nGiven the context of our conversation, I think they might be:\n- Waiting for me to say something after my last message about 易错题\n- Confused about something\n- Maybe the message didn't come through properly\n\nI should just respond simply and ask what they mean, keeping it casual.","thinkingSignature":"7f93faf13e1ce772050da7ecfa22f9a0b7e5d341a8bf4b40331db08888a6486b"},{"type":"text","text":"怎么了频哥？是刚才的分析哪里不清楚，还是发错消息了？😄"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":142,"output":133,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":60062,"totalTokens":60337,"cost":{"input":0.0000426,"output":0.0001596,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.02252325,"total":0.02272545}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775801932236,"responseId":"0627c94c6fbb21b2cc14076bfcc4094c"}}
