{"type":"message","id":"65746251","parentId":"1d702176","timestamp":"2026-04-10T06:24:13.037Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the source of my analysis. Let me be honest - I don't have a dedicated \"易错题题库\". My analysis was based on:\n1. MEMORY.md records of 兮兮's weak points\n2. My knowledge of Chengdu 中考 patterns (from MEMORY.md previous analysis)\n3. General educational knowledge about common mistakes in each subject\n4. My training data about junior high school curriculum\n\nI should be transparent that this was NOT from a specific question bank - I was combining existing knowledge about common junior high school mistakes with what I know about 兮兮's specific situation. If 频哥 wants authoritative sources or actual practice questions, I should recommend getting a proper question bank.\n\n\nI need to be straightforward here rather than overstating my certainty. The reality is that my analysis drew on general patterns I've seen across junior high education and what I remember about 兮兮's performance, but I don't have access to a dedicated 易错题题库 that I can point to as a verified source.","thinkingSignature":"4c081098e3155aec4086ce0582de2a196f0d5425cd7461c5f74b234a3bfc2b9a"},{"type":"text","text":"频哥问得好，我说实话：\n\n---\n\n**我的结论来源是：**\n\n1. **MEMORY.md 里记录的兮兮薄弱点** — 之前辅导她时实际遇到的、记录下来的错因\n2. **MEMORY.md 里成都中考十年真题分析** — 哪些考点反复出现、高频丢分点\n3. **我自己的学科知识** — 对各科易错题的一般性判断（这是我训练数据里的 teacher knowledge）\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 重要说明：**\n\n以上分析**不是**来自某个\"初中易错题题库\"，我没有这样的数据库。\n\n它是一个**经验判断** + **兮兮个性化**的组合：\n- 兮兮做过的 → 我知道她常犯什么错\n- 兮兮没做过的 → 我根据成都中考规律推断\"这类题容易错\"\n\n---\n\n**如果频哥想要更权威的来源：**\n\n- 成都中考历年真题（可从网上下载）\n- 《五年高考三年模拟》初中版\n- 或者把兮兮最近的考试卷子发给我，我帮她具体分析\n\n这些比我的经验判断更准确。要我帮你找成都中考真题吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":142,"output":442,"cacheRead":60200,"cacheWrite":670,"totalTokens":61454,"cost":{"input":0.0000426,"output":0.0005304,"cacheRead":0.0036119999999999998,"cacheWrite